/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  Case-local DELTA of the standard K2SO4 record: the one line this case needs.
  `overlayOf K2SO4;` -- the reader deep-merges this file over
  data/standards/components/K2SO4.dat, so everything else comes from the catalogue.
  The case exists to show the engine REFUSING a rank-deficient salt basis; the
  refusal is only reached when each salt is declared reactive (an aqueous
  speciation), which the catalogue record of K2SO4 does not declare.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
overlayOf K2SO4;
variationReason "declares the salt reactive (aqueousSpeciation K2SO4Salt) so the basis-rank refusal, not an unrelated adapter refusal, is the case's outcome";

aqueousSpeciation  K2SO4Salt;
